in="00:25.290" end="00:26.640">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.910" end="00:29.970"><span begin="00:26.910" end="00:27.180">I </span><span begin="00:27.180" end="00:27.540">will </span><span begin="00:27.540" end="00:27.960">not </span><span begin="00:27.960" end="00:28.470">leave </span><span begin="00:28.470" end="00:29.970">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.180" end="00:33.120"><span begin="00:30.180" end="00:31.170">Everything </span><span begin="00:31.170" end="00:31.650">that </span><span begin="00:31.650" end="00:32.100">I </span><span begin="00:32.100" end="00:33.120">own</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.270" end="00:36.690"><span begin="00:33.270" end="00:33.570">To </span><span begin="00:33.570" end="00:34.020">make </span><span begin="00:34.020" end="00:34.260">you </span><span begin="00:34.260" end="00:34.800">feel </span><span begin="00:34.800" end="00:35.250">like </span><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:35.430">it's </span><span begin="00:35.430" end="00:35.760">not </span><span begin="00:35.760" end="00:36.120">too </span><span begin="00:36.120" end="00:36.690">late</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.780" end="00:38.910"><span begin="00:36.780" end="00:37.020">It's </span><span begin="00:37.020" end="00:37.380">never </span><span begin="00:37.380" end="00:37.740">too </span><span begin="00:37.740" end="00:38.910">late</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.690" end="00:42.840"><span begin="00:39.690" end="00:40.260">Even </span><span begin="00:40.260" end="00:40.620">if </span><span begin="00:40.620" end="00:40.830">I </span><span begin="00:40.830" end="00:42.840">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.930" end="00:45.990"><span begin="00:42.930" end="00:43.320">It'll </span><span begin="00:43.320" end="00:44.010">be </span><span begin="00:44.010" end="00:45.990">alright</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.020" end="00:48.510"><span begin="00:46.020" end="00:46.410">Still </span><span begin="00:46.410" end="00:46.590">I </span><span begin="00:46.590" end="00:46.920">hear </span><span begin="00:46.920" end="00:47.220">you </span><span begin="00:47.220" end="00:48.510">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.510" end="00:51.960"><span begin="00:48.510" end="00:48.780">You </span><span begin="00:48.780" end="00:49.170">want </span><span begin="00:49.170" end="00:49.410">to </span><span begin="00:49.410" end="00:49.920">end </span><span begin="00:49.920" end="00:50.550">your </span><span begin="00:50.550" end="00:51.960">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.230" end="00:54.990"><span begin="00:52.230" end="00:52.680">Now </span><span begin="00:52.680" end="00:52.860">and </span><span begin="00:52.860" end="00:53.370">again </span><span begin="00:53.370" end="00:53.670">we </span><span begin="00:53.670" end="00:54.990">try</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.990" end="00:57.990"><span begin="00:54.990" end="00:55.170">To </span><span begin="00:55.170" end="00:55.590">just </span><span begin="00:55.590" end="00:56.490">stay </span><span begin="00:56.490" end="00:57.990">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.050" end="01:00.120"><span begin="00:58.050" end="00:58.530">Maybe </span><span begin="00:58.530" end="00:58.920">we'll </span><span begin="00:58.920" end="00:59.250">turn </span><span begin="00:59.250" end="00:59.460">it </span><span begin="00:59.460" end="01:00.120">around</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.120" end="01:02.310"><span begin="01:00.120" end="01:00.480">'Cause </span><span begin="01:00.480" end="01:00.870">it's </span><span begin="01:00.870" end="01:01.320">not </span><span begin="01:01.320" end="01:01.710">too </span><span begin="01:01.710" end="01:02.310">late</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.340" end="01:04.890"><span begin="01:02.340" end="01:02.580">It's </span><span begin="01:02.580" end="01:02.940">never </span><span begin="01:02.940" end="01:03.330">too </span><span begin="01:03.330" end="01:04.890">late</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.310" end="01:08.340"><span begin="01:05.310" end="01:05.580">No </span><span begin="01:05.580" end="01:05.970">one </span><span begin="01:05.970" end="01:06.450">will </span><span begin="01:06.450" end="01:07.050">ever </span><span begin="01:07.050" end="01:08.340">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.520" end="01:11.520"><span begin="01:08.520" end="01:08.760">This </span><span begin="01:08.760" end="01:09.210">side </span><span begin="01:09.210" end="01:11.520">reflected</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.790" end="01:14.700"><span begin="01:11.790" end="01:12.240">And </span><span begin="01:12.240" end="01:12.390">if </span><span begin="01:12.390" end="01:12.690">there's </span><span begin="01:12.690" end="01:13.470">something </span><span begin="01:13.470" end="01:14.700">wrong</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.790" end="01:17.880"><span begin="01:14.790" end="01:15.360">Who </span><span begin="01:15.360" end="01:15.660">would </span><span begin="01:15.660" end="01:15.900">have </span><span begin="01:15.900" end="01:16.440">guessed </span><span begin="01:16.440" end="01:17.880">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.180" end="01:21.180"><span begin="01:18.180" end="01:18.480">And </span><span begin="01:18.480" end="01:18.870">I </span><span begin="01:18.870" end="01:19.050">have </span><span begin="01:19.050" end="01:19.680">left </span><span begin="01:19.680" end="01:21.180">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.390" end="01:24.330"><span begin="01:21.390" end="01:22.380">Everything </span><span begin="01:22.380" end="01:22.860">that </span><span begin="01:22.860" end="01:23.310">I </span><span begin="01:23.310" end="01:24.330">own</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.480" end="01:26.430"><span begin="01:24.480" end="01:24.750">To </span><span begin="01:24.750" end="01:25.230">make </span><span begin="01:25.230" end="01:25.500">you </span><span begin="01:25.500" end="01:26.010">feel </span><span begin="01:26.010" end="01:26.430">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.430" end="01:27.840"><span begin="01:26.430" end="01:26.640">It's </span><span begin="01:26.640" end="01:26.910">not </span><span begin="01:26.910" end="01:27.330">too </span><span begin="01:27.330" end="01:27.840">late</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.960" end="01:30.420"><span begin="01:27.960" end="01:28.200">It's </span><span begin="01:28.200" end="01:28.590">never </span><span begin="01:28.590" end="01:28.980">too </span><span begin="01:28.980" end="01:30.420">late</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.870" end="01:34.050"><span begin="01:30.870" end="01:31.440">Even </span><span begin="01:31.440" end="01:31.830">if </span><span begin="01:31.830" end="01:32.040">I </span><span begin="01:32.040" end="01:34.050">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.110" end="01:37.200"><span begin="01:34.110" end="01:34.530">It'll </span><span begin="01:34.530" end="01:35.190">be </span><span begin="01:35.190" end="01:37.200">alright</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.230" end="01:39.690"><span begin="01:37.230" end="01:37.620">Still </span><span begin="01:37.620" end="01:37.800">I </span><span begin="01:37.800" end="01:38.130">hear </span><span begin="01:38.130" end="01:38.430">you </span><span begin="01:38.430" end="01:39.690">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.690" end="01:43.170"><span begin="01:39.690" end="01:39.990">You </span><span begin="01:39.990" end="01:40.380">want </span><span begin="01:40.380" end="01:40.620">to </span><span begin="01:40.620" end="01:41.190">end </span><span begin="01:41.190" end="01:41.760">your </span><span begin="01:41.760" end="01:43.170">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.530" end="01:46.200"><span begin="01:43.530" end="01:43.860">Now </span><span begin="01:43.860" end="01:44.070">and </span><span begin="01:44.070" end="01:44.580">again </span><span begin="01:44.580" end="01:44.850">we </span><span b